# {{{npmName}}}

Angular **22.1** client for the {{{npmName}}} API, generated by `yaver-ng-client`.

- **Reads** (GET/HEAD returning JSON) are generated as `httpResource`-based
  injection-context initializers: `injectXxxResource(() => params)`.
- **Commands** (POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE), uploads, downloads and streams are
  typed RxJS `Observable<T>` APIs on injectable `*Api` classes.
- **Zoneless by construction** — no `zone.js`, no `NgZone`, no generated
  subscriptions or effects.
- The client never calls `provideHttpClient()`; your application owns the
  HTTP stack (backends, interceptors, transfer cache).

## Installation (npm)

```bash
npm install {{{npmName}}}
```

## Setup

```ts
import { bootstrapApplication } from '@angular/platform-browser';
import { provideHttpClient } from '@angular/common/http';
import { provideZonelessChangeDetection } from '@angular/core';
import { {{providerFnName}} } from '{{{npmName}}}';

bootstrapApplication(AppComponent, {
  providers: [
    provideZonelessChangeDetection(),
    // the application owns the HTTP stack:
    provideHttpClient(),
    {{providerFnName}}({ basePath: environment.apiUrl }),
  ],
});
```

## Queries

```ts
@Component({ /* ... */ })
export class TenantListComponent {
  private readonly filter = signal<TenantFilter>({});

  readonly tenants = injectListTenantsResource(() => this.filter());

  // Conditional / idle:
  readonly tenant = injectGetTenantResource(() => {
    const tenantId = this.tenantId();
    return tenantId ? { tenantId } : undefined;
  });
}
```

Resources expose `value()`, `hasValue()`, `status()`, `error()`,
`isLoading()`, `reload()` per the Angular resource API.

## Mutations

```ts
private readonly tenantsApi = inject(TenantsApi);

save(request: CreateTenantRequest): Observable<CreateTenantResponse> {
  return this.tenantsApi.createTenant({ body: request });
}

// imperative boundary:
await firstValueFrom(this.tenantsApi.createTenant({ body: request }));
```

## Signal Forms

```ts
import { form } from '@angular/forms/signals';
import { createTenantRequestSchema } from '{{{npmName}}}/forms';

readonly model = signal<CreateTenantRequest>({});
readonly tenantForm = form(this.model, createTenantRequestSchema, {
  submission: {
    action: async (field) => {
      await firstValueFrom(this.tenantsApi.createTenant({ body: field().value() }));
    },
  },
});
```

